{"4687030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ribbit Riot!", "steam_appid": 4687030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4687030/extras/36479d4b7ee0380b3c1ddfd68bcd3d6a.avif?t=1784266633\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4687030/extras_big/36479d4b7ee0380b3c1ddfd68bcd3d6a.webp?t=1784266633 width=1560 height=497 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ribbit Riot! is a <strong>one-button incremental chaos game</strong> about unleashing frogs, destroying a tiny city, and stacking upgrades to spiral everything out of control. Play through 20+ levels (2–3 hours) as you experiment with different frog builds and push each run into bigger, dumber, and more explosive outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Click the FROG button to spawn frogs.</strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4687030/extras/df4f2eff7c83adf8ff08bca4cf481fad.poster.avif?t=1784266633\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4687030/extras/df4f2eff7c83adf8ff08bca4cf481fad.webm?t=1784266633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4687030/extras/df4f2eff7c83adf8ff08bca4cf481fad.mp4?t=1784266633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Watch  frogs cause chaos.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4687030/extras/9f5ae223d9e579c039b6fab3432caec2.poster.avif?t=1784266633\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4687030/extras/9f5ae223d9e579c039b6fab3432caec2.webm?t=1784266633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4687030/extras/9f5ae223d9e579c039b6fab3432caec2.mp4?t=1784266633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Spend chaos on silly upgrades.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4687030/extras/37fead78f9e8cd67519cbce9b5e59782.poster.avif?t=1784266633\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4687030/extras/37fead78f9e8cd67519cbce9b5e59782.webm?t=1784266633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4687030/extras/37fead78f9e8cd67519cbce9b5e59782.mp4?t=1784266633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Watch everything spiral out of control!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4687030/extras/62dc9d9a4f5d1d5bd249b0c788d844bf.poster.avif?t=1784266633\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4687030/extras/62dc9d9a4f5d1d5bd249b0c788d844bf.webm?t=1784266633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4687030/extras/62dc9d9a4f5d1d5bd249b0c788d844bf.mp4?t=1784266633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">